Record: summary
Purpose: Independent finite reference for tests/testthat/test-cp02-gap-dgp.R (D27 eight gap laws).
Method: Executes only the unchanged import/function definitions of check_finite.py (finite_catalog, rank) through its AST, never its file-writing footer, for the eight laws in both NT/NYT modes; endpoint coordinates come from the original row terms and coordinate availability from the same rank criterion as post_level_estimable. Rational truths are copied from the pinned finite_check.json and law_map.json. No RNG, R source or implementation output.
